What it is
Writers type in Quill (library) with the Snow toolbar. The product wrapper is RichTextEditor.jsx. Book Editor and uploaded manuscripts wrap that in ManuscriptDraftEditor.jsx for save/dirty/word count. Capture Idea and Final Draft use RichTextEditor directly.

Quill only edits. Save, word count, and Word files are not Quill features.

